[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://resources/log_entry.gd" id="1_script"]

[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_script")
log_id = "log_007_vey_responsive"
title = "It Responded"
author = "Vey, S. — Xenosignal Analyst"
date = "Station Day 876"
content = "It responded.

I sent the calibration pulse. Standard galactic greeting protocol. Mathematical primes, hydrogen line reference, nothing exotic.

Within 4.2 seconds — FOUR POINT TWO SECONDS — we received a return signal. Modified. It took our structure and... added to it. Completed the mathematical sequence and then continued with patterns I don't recognize.

4.2 seconds. The signal origin is 200 light-years away. That's not a response. That's not possible. Unless it's not 200 light-years away. Unless it's everywhere. Unless it was already listening.

My hands won't stop shaking."
category = "late"
sort_order = 7
